{"id": "type7-neg-return-reference-holder", "rules": ["TYPE-7", "OWN-1"], "expect": {"kind": "reject", "rule": "TYPE-7"}, "status": "runnable", "doc": "Returning a referent value cannot implicitly read a reference holder, even though affine return position has contextual consumption."}
