{"id": "own1-neg-return-borrowed-box", "rules": ["OWN-1", "TYPE-7"], "expect": {"kind": "reject", "rule": "OWN-1"}, "status": "runnable", "doc": "One dereference of a shared reference to box<State> exposes a non-owning box value, not the Copy State inside it; contextual return rejects the transfer."}
