{"id":"fn8-pos-requires-eeq","rules":["FN-8","OP-1","OP-8"],"expect":{"kind":"run","exit":0},"status":"runnable","doc":"Exact-domain enum equality is pure and total, may form the complete requirement goal, and is discharged by structurally identical caller evidence without adding equality to L0."}
