{"id":"x-buffer-borrowed-columns-run","rules":["GRAM-4","FN-8","OWN-3","OWN-4","OWN-5","OWN-7","OWN-10","OWN-12","TYPE-7","EFF-2","SET-1","OP-4"],"expect":{"kind":"run","exit":0},"status":"runnable","doc":"Distinct projected buffer fields are uniquely borrowed into a fill helper, then shared-borrowed into a fold helper. Ordinary caller branches establish both declared length requirements, and counted-range binder facts combine with those requirements to prove every indexed access before execution."}
