{"id":"x-borrowed-pool-tree-run","rules":["TYPE-2","OWN-1","OWN-3","OWN-4","OWN-5","OWN-7","OWN-10","OWN-12","TYPE-7","EFF-2","SET-1","OP-1","OP-4","OP-9","STOR-3"],"expect":{"kind":"run","exit":0},"status":"runnable","doc":"A structure-of-arrays pool builds and recursively validates a complete binary tree through whole-struct unique and shared borrows. Bounds and arithmetic failures use explicit typed PoolError results, main maps failures to nonzero statuses, and projected access, caller-visible storage, effects, and owner-only cleanup all use the normal compiler path."}
