{"id":"x-base64-rfc-vectors-run","rules":["CONST-1","CONST-2","FN-8","FN-9","ENT-3","OP-6","OP-1","OP-4","OP-9","OWN-1","OWN-3","OWN-4","OWN-5","OWN-10","OWN-12","TYPE-7","EFF-2","SET-1","STOR-3"],"expect":{"kind":"run","exit":0},"status":"runnable","doc":"The complete scalar base64 encoder executes the RFC 4648 Man, M, and Ma vectors. Deterministic unsigned-remainder facts publish every table index bound; typed read/write helpers consume those facts directly, out-of-range paths return IndexError, callers establish capacity by ordinary branches, and distinct status controls observe every encoded length and byte while preserving ownership cleanup."}
