{"id":"fn3-neg-missing-binding","rules":["FN-3"],"expect":{"kind":"reject","rule":"FN-3"},"status":"runnable","doc":"A conformance that omits the contract's second declared member is incomplete; FN-3 rejects at the conform closing brace and publishes no partial binding vector."}
{"id":"fn3-neg-extra-binding","rules":["FN-3"],"expect":{"kind":"reject","rule":"FN-3"},"status":"runnable","doc":"A conformance has one binding beyond its contract's complete member table; the extra binding is rejected by FN-3 rather than inferred as a member."}
{"id":"fn3-neg-out-of-order-binding","rules":["FN-3"],"expect":{"kind":"reject","rule":"FN-3"},"status":"runnable","doc":"A complete set of bindings written in a different order from the contract's member declarations is rejected by FN-3; signature matching does not reorder it."}
