{"id":"fn3-neg-source-contract-bound","rules":["FN-2","FN-3"],"expect":{"kind":"reject","rule":"FN-3"},"status":"runnable","doc":"Only the prelude Int and Float markers may bound a generic type parameter in the active specification; a successfully resolved source-contract bound is rejected by FN-3 and grants no behavior."}
{"id":"fn3-pos-normalized-region-effects","rules":["FN-1","FN-3","EFF-1","EFF-2"],"expect":{"kind":"accept"},"status":"runnable","doc":"A region-bearing member and function have positionally alpha-equivalent signatures; independently valid effect rows normalize to the same read-region set despite reversed payload order."}
